  "contentHtml": "\n                                    \n\n                                                                            <p><img src=\"https://health.economictimes.indiatimes.com/Themes/Release/theme4/images/icons/et-default-user.svg\" alt=\"Online Bureau\">\n                                            \n                                        </p>\n                                                                        \n                                                                                    <ul>\n                                                                                                    <li>\n                                                                                                                                                                            <a>Online Bureau</a>\n                                                            \n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        \n                                                                                                            </li>\n                                                                                                                                                    <li><a href=\"/agency/88675629/ETHealthWorld\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">ETHealthWorld</a></li>\n                                                                                            </ul>\n                                                                                <ul>\n                                                                                            <li>Published On Nov 27, 2026 at 06:23 PM IST</li>\n                                                                                                                                </ul>\n                                    \n                                                                            \n                                                                        \n                                \n                                \n\n                    <!-- Display video article in news article for the custom next story -->\n                    \n                    <!-- Modifying the body placing embeds,promoslots,related etc.-->\n                                        <figure><img src=\"/images/default.jpg\" alt=\"\"></figure><p>At the ETHealthworld Nutriwell Conclave 2026, the panel discussion titled “The Missing Piece in <a href=\"/tag/weight+management\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Weight Management</a>: The Role of Structured Nutrition” explored <a href=\"/tag/evidence-based+dietary+interventions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">evidence-based dietary interventions</a>, <a href=\"/tag/personalised+nutrition\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">personalised nutrition</a> and <a href=\"/tag/sustainable+weight+management\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">sustainable weight management</a> strategies.Moderating the session, Ambika Nair, Clinical Nutritionist, Sehat Plus, Director, My Nutritional Needs, and Secretary, Indian Dietetic Association, emphasised a food-first approach supported by individual nutritional assessments, dietary adherence and regular clinical monitoring. She highlighted the potential role of meal replacements when conventional dietary interventions prove inadequate.</p><!-- PROMOSLOT_M -->\n                            <p>Advt\n                            </p>\n\n                              \n                                                         \n                        <p>Sheryl Salis, Founder &amp; Director, Nurture Health Solutions and Nurture Health Academy and Research Centre, highlighted the importance of moving beyond calorie counting towards dietary diversity, adequate protein intake, portion control, physical activity and sleep management. She also stressed the need for scientifically validated nutritional products and transparent labelling.</p><!-- PROMOSLOT_M --><p>Aishwarya Kumbhakoni, Consultant Dietician, Diabetes, Kokilaben Dhirubhai Ambani Hospital, discussed how partial meal replacements can support selected patients struggling with weight management. She emphasised personalised interventions based on individual health conditions, dietary preferences and clinical requirements.</p><p>Sandhya Pandey, General Manager and Chief Dietician, Medanta Hospital, Gurgaon, highlighted the importance of preserving lean muscle mass, particularly among patients undergoing GLP-1 therapy. She stressed adequate protein intake, micronutrient management and regular monitoring to prevent nutritional deficiencies.</p><!-- PROMOSLOT_M --><p>The panel also discussed the importance of developing weight maintenance strategies before discontinuing GLP-1 therapy, alongside sustainable dietary habits and resistance training.Powered by Dr. Reddy’s Nestlé Health Sciences, the session reinforced that effective weight management requires structured nutritional interventions rather than quick fixes or restrictive diets.</p><!-- PROMOSLOT_M -->\n                            <p>Advt\n                            </p>\n\n                              \n                                                         \n                        <p>Key takeaways:</p><ul><li>Prioritise personalised, evidence-based nutritional interventions.</li><li>Focus on <a href=\"/tag/nutritional+adequacy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">nutritional adequacy</a> alongside weight reduction.</li><li>Consider meal replacements under qualified professional guidance.</li><li>Preserve lean muscle mass during weight loss.</li><li>Develop sustainable strategies for long-term weight maintenance.</li></ul>                    <!-- Category Most Read Placement -->\n                                                                    \n                                                                \n                                <ul>\n                                                                            <!-- <li>By <span>Online Bureau</span>,</li> -->\n                                    \n\n                                                                            <li>By\n                                                                                            <a>Online Bureau</a>\n                                                                                                                                                                                        , \n                                                                                    </li>\n                                                                                                                <li><a href=\"/agency/88675629/ETHealthWorld\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">ETHealthWorld</a></li>\n                                                                    </ul>\n                                <ul>\n                                    <!-- <li> Updated On Nov 27, 2026 at 06:23 PM IST</li> -->\n                                    <li>Published On Nov 27, 2026 at 06:23 PM IST</li>\n                                    <!-- <li class=\"desktop-view\">1 min read</li> -->\n                                </ul>\n                            \n                                        \n\n                    \n\n                    <!-- Comment Section -->\n                                            \n                                        <!-- Comment Section -->\n\n                    \n                      \n    \n            <p>\n                </p><h2>Join the community of 2M+ industry professionals. </h2>   \n                <h3>Subscribe to Newsletter to get latest insights &amp; analysis in your inbox.</h3>\n            <p></p>\n\n            <!